C   NOUTTD  ;  Number of hydrographs to be printed
C   FACTVLOU;  Factor to convert simulation unit of tile drain/subsurface irrigation
C                flows into intented output unit 
C   UNITVLOU;  Output unit of flows (max. 10 characters long)
C   TDOUTFL ;  Filename for tile drain/subsurface irrigation hydrograph output
C                (max. 1000 characters)
